        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "1.1 集合初步"
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p16_b1",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "body",
      "bbox": [
        95,
        95,
        665,
        138
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "可以用文氏图直观地反映 $A \\cap B$ 的几种不同情况，如图 1-1-4 所示."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p16_f1",
      "kind": "figure",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "figure",
      "bbox": [
        130,
        150,
        630,
        255
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": "p16_f1",
      "content": {
        "text": null,
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": {
          "caption": "图 1-1-4"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p16_aside1",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "aside_right",
      "role": "note",
      "bbox": [
        700,
        145,
        870,
        220
      ],
      "anchor_id": "p16_f1",
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "对照图 1-1-4 的三种情况，请各举一实例."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p16_b2",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "body",
      "bbox": [
        95,
        290,
        665,
        400
      ],
      "anchor_id": "p16_f1",
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "图 1-1-4(1) 表示集合 $A$ 与 $B$ 既有公共元素又都有非公共元素的情况，此时阴影部分 $A \\cap B$ 既是 $A$ 的真子集又是 $B$ 的真子集；图 1-1-4(2) 表示集合 $A$ 是 $B$ 的子集的情况，此时 $A \\cap B = A$；图 1-1-4(3) 表示集合 $A$ 与 $B$ 没有公共元素的情况，此时 $A \\cap B = \\varnothing$."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p16_b3",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        95,
        405,
        665,
        475
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "例 9 已知集合 $A=\\{(x,y) \\mid 2x+y=5\\}$，$B=\\{(x,y) \\mid 3x+2y=8\\}$. 求 $A \\cap B$."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p16_b4",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        95,
        470,
        665,
        590
      ],
      "anchor_id": "p16_b3",
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "解 由题意，$(x,y) \\in A \\cap B$ 表示 $(x,y)$ 既属于 $A$ 又属于 $B$，即 $(x,y)$ 是方程组 $\\begin{cases} 2x+y=5, \\\\ 3x+2y=8 \\end{cases}$ 的解，所以 $x=2$，$y=1$. 于是，$A \\cap B = \\{(2,1)\\}$."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p16_aside2",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "aside_right",
      "role": "note",
      "bbox": [
        700,
        470,
        870,
        615
      ],
      "anchor_id": "p16_b4",
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "例 9 中，$A \\cap B$ 表示二元一次方程组的所有解组成的集合. 它可以理解为两个一次函数 $y=-2x+5$ 与 $y=-\\frac{3}{2}x+4$ 的图像的交点组成的集合."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p16_b5",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "body",
      "bbox": [
        95,
        595,
        665,
        635
      ],
      "anchor_id": "p16_b4",
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "其次，我们可以把两个已知集合的所有元素放在一起组成一个新的集合."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p16_b6",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "definition",
      "bbox": [
        95,
        640,
        665,
        705
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "定义 由所有属于集合 $A$ 或属于集合 $B$ 的元素所组成的集合，叫做集合 $A$ 与 $B$ 的并集（union），记作 $A \\cup B$（读作“$A$ 并 $B$”），即 $A \\cup B = \\{x \\mid x \\in A \\text{ 或 } x \\in B\\}$."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p16_b7",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "body",
      "bbox": [
        95,
        735,
        665,
        775
      ],
      "anchor_id": "p16_b6",
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "可以用文氏图直观地反映 $A \\cup B$ 的几种不同情况，如图 1-1-5 所示，其中阴影部分表示 $A \\cup B$."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
